# Run OUTPUT and per-GPU baselines. The .pt baselines are large (24 MB for tier
# B), are only meaningful for the GPU model that produced them, and are
# rewritten by every `--save`; the .out / .log files are one run's transcript.
# The tooling that produces them IS tracked -- see gate/README.md.
